<title>UK: Both Brent cargoes kept - trade. [CORRECTED 17:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>Both Brent cargoes kept - trade. [CORRECTED 17:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Both Brent cargoes (corrects to two cargoes, from three) due to turn wet on Friday were kept from the paper chains, trading sources said.</p>
<p>The two of the cargoes, due to load Sept 28-30, were kept by Wall Street trader J.P. Morgan who also kept all three of Thursday's dates.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7456</p>
